      "cooked": "<p>Another \"get to know a little something about the forumites\" thread...</p><p>What unusual items do you like to collect?</p><p>(Looking for things other than the obvious answers of boardgames, comic books, or SF/F books as I suspect lots of people on the forum collect those.)</p><p>Personally, I've got a bunch of odd collections around the house, but the two things I always look for at antiques markets and yard sales are: <a href=\"http://i.imgur.com/lnK4aUm.jpg\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">vintage group photos </a>(esp. ones with unusual outfits or settings) and <a href=\"http://i.imgur.com/DJ6Xib2.jpg\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">Baedecker's Guides from the Golden Age of Travel </a>(mine span roughly 1885-1925).</p><p>&nbsp;</p>",
