    {
      "id": 147382,
      "name": "Silverleaf",
      "username": "Silverleaf",
      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/silverleaf/{size}/2332_2.png",
      "created_at": "2015-09-10T07:20:10.000Z",
      "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote group-playtesters\" data-username=\"arenson9\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/arenson9/48/1900_2.png\" class=\"avatar\"> arenson9:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>I collect quotes by my spouse.</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>Oh, I collect quotes to (but not usually by Andy's wife ;)).</p>\n<p>I write down amusing things that people say that make me laugh, and I don't note who said them or what the context was. This makes them much funnier and weirder reading them back. I hadn't thought of them as a collection, but they definitely are!</p>",
      "post_number": 8,
      "post_type": 1,
